  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2025</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">학년도 목감고등학교</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">기간제교원 구합니다<br>1학년 공통과학 1학기 수업이에요</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a721702006023d1d8bdbe20976e1905e8d84cf2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2a721702006023d1d8bdbe20976e1905e8d84cf2\" data-origin-width=\"1\" data-origin-height=\"1\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">채용</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; 가</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">채용권자</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">목감고등학교장</span></p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 99.3703%; height: 155px;\" border=\"1\" data-ke-style=\"style12\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 66px;\"><td style=\"height: 66px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">과목</span></td><td style=\"height: 66px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">인원</span></td><td style=\"height: 66px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">임용예정기간</span></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 59px;\"><td style=\"height: 59px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">화학(과학)</span></td><td style=\"height: 59px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">명</span></td><td style=\"height: 59px; text-align: justify;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2025.3.1.~ 2025.8.31.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; 나</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">. </span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">화학</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">:&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">중등 화학</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">,&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">통합과학</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">,&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">물리</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">,&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">생명과학</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">,&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">지구과학 자격증 소지자</span><br><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">&#160; &#160;</span><span style=\"color: #0000FF;\">&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2. </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">원서 접수</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; 가</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">접수기간&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:</span> <span data-ke-size=\"size18\">2.20 ~</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; 나</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">접수처&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">:&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">목감고등학교&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">층 교무실&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">문의&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">☎&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">031-460-8900)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; 【</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">학교주소&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#8211;&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">경기도 시흥시 목감둘레로&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">150</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">】</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; 다</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">.&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">접수방법</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">택&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">1)</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; &#160;&#160;1)&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이메일</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">(jesussalom</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">@korea.kr</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">)</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">로&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">①&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이력서와&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">②&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">자기소개서 전송&#160;</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;③ </span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">비위면직자 등 취업 제한 관련 체크리스트</span><br><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">&#160; &#160;&#160;2)&#160;</span><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">방문 접수</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
